<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;More fun facts! I once wrote a script to search a word list for words that make valid regexen which convert one valid word into another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
$ perl -le 'print bangs =~s engender'
bands
$ perl -le 'print halved =~s avatar'
halted
$ perl -le 'print stove =~s evener'
stone
&lt;/c&gt;
</doctext>
